  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-Nepal Policy Dialogue Support Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective (Impact) to which the present action contributes is to substantially increase visibility, awareness, understanding and perception of the EU in Nepal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Specific objectives&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Improved EU Delegation&#xbf;s engagement with key stakeholders and key target audiences across Nepal to support the EU policy agenda (such as government, parliament, development partners, civil society, youth, students &amp;amp; academics (including TVET), think tanks, social partners, media, business community and business start-ups/accelerators, trade unions, cultural sector, local communities, including both EU citizens in Nepal and in the EU); and&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Meaningful improvements to policies and/or programmes in Nepal supported by the EU.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
